Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 03:18:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] Unify HiSparse rank-local host lease teardown

Normalize both allocator entry points to one typed lease, keep the existing positional provider ABI, and retain failed teardown state until a safe retry.

Co-authored-by: OpenAI Codex <codex@openai.com>
Signed-off-by: Kitepond contributors <kitepond-dev@users.noreply.github.com>
